  intro F E _ _ _ _ _ σ hCM M J hJ n hn ψ hψ dx hdx Φ hΦ
  exact (GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SiegelND.CoefSum.continuous_integrable_tuple σ hCM M n dx hdx.1 Φ hΦ).2

